<description>&lt;p&gt;Sudan has accused Ethiopia of permitting RSF drones to launch from Ethiopian territory, prompting reciprocal consulate closures and expulsions of diplomats by both sides. The conflict has intensified humanitarian strain, with UN warnings that deadly drone strikes are harming civilians, displaced elderly facing basic-needs shortages, and factories struggling to restart after wartime damage. Bread prices have doubled in Khartoum, deepening a food crisis that threatens further hunger. The war produced 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNc1N1NjlSa05wVFlyS1MtcnNUVktKRjlrSDI3TW5wQ1RadVRYNHFJNzdOS2ZRZGw4S1dDa0xJVl9OM2N6QXhFa0psWnFrQzF6aUhUMXZtS283V3NfUC1qdm92MjRBVUlWSGIyRGd2NENwaEFpNUlVSVVVX2ZNZEFxUl9lVUktaVZPQmZ1TC1obXJoWGszUVFBSlZBc3ZaNXFPeW1zZGVjZ3h3ckVwUzdyc0s5UDRSUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFBvQk5ORVBaZjk4WEF5dVZwWDZaOVNidkJJZDFQOF9FWVZUR2ZRZkVReHZlV1N0N2kwazF3Rk1pZkFGSjZNN1dPdWl2SEhiYWhfekRfN1NIVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxOVFlMdVhaMDlaWFJjano5UE5Dclo0Ymxta3BrZWFoeWItWUhrSXpsbjRjb1pINF8xZVBMbHdfZzZodktNdmphLXlObkhkOHdtTmMtNnlFUGE0Rlp6eDVEQnFEWXhZTVNEUGJ2NXVNUE9uS0FocGt4SkhWUzQwR1UxZGdCa2s2N29Xc0k3QXVnNEJteEZpOG9hLTRpcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Johannesburg Sunday World&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxObmR3TkticHlHQzd1T0NGU3h2V0RaTURxWmtlQ3pMYkp1OUNhZ19Ndl9WLVhOWjVmbE1PMkNiV2xuU3M1WDctTUJTbjJQZGZ1aGdJbGZlQW